## Welcome

This is the main J.A.R.V.I.S. Project repository! This is the main system where everything is put together and assembled. Brick By Brick! If there are any issues or interesting Ideas you would like to see added to this repository please let me know and I will do my best to fabricate and create those ideas to turn them into a reality.

This is my life's work, so please let me know of any improvements that can be made. If you are looking for my plugins repositories for this project please go to the [JARVIS-Plugins-Index](https://github.com/Silewis37/JARVIS-Plugin-List) repository on my page!

---

Thank you all for the Support of this project! And I promise it will continue to be updated! Enjoy the fruits of all of my labor and time spent on this project!
